      "reading": "Design rehearsals run about 1.7 times slower on macos-15 than on macos-26, and about 1.4 times slower than on macos-14 at alpha.39; the rehearsal without design is about the same everywhere. Send admission audits the prepared bundle while the page reads the job every 2 s. The job page abandons a decision request after 45 s (packages/board/src/job-render.ts), so on a machine this slow a person could see an error while the Send is still being admitted. Not caused by this release's changes and not fixed in it.",
      "decision": "The release builds and runs core validation on macos-15, as tested on every push, and runs its rehearsals on macos-latest, where they passed. The slow admission is recorded as an open defect."
    }
